{"parse": {"title": "高阶秘物箱子", "pageid": 2287, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"高阶秘物箱子\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f1/Item-501001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"高阶秘物箱子\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>高阶秘物箱子</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#501003</div></div><hr /><div>神秘的方形箱子。可获得下列全部高阶材料，用于角色的洞悉与共鸣。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">暗自许下的愿望，被安置于角落的秘密，遗失在漫长年岁中的秘藏。那些真正的难寻之物。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110103\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\"><img alt=\"啮咬盒\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/100px-Item-110103.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/150px-Item-110103.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Item-110103.png/200px-Item-110103.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%95%AE%E5%92%AC%E7%9B%92\" title=\"啮咬盒\">啮咬盒</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">古怪的盒子。沉甸甸的，偶有怪声传出。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110203\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\"><img alt=\"盐封曼德拉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/100px-Item-110203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/150px-Item-110203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Item-110203.png/200px-Item-110203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%90%E5%B0%81%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89\" title=\"盐封曼德拉\">盐封曼德拉</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">曼德拉草。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110303\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E5%A4%B4%E5%BD%A2%E9%AA%A8%E6%9E%B6\" title=\"双头形骨架\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E5%A4%B4%E5%BD%A2%E9%AA%A8%E6%9E%B6\" title=\"双头形骨架\"><img alt=\"双头形骨架\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Item-110303.png/100px-Item-110303.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Item-110303.png/150px-Item-110303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Item-110303.png/200px-Item-110303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8C%E5%A4%B4%E5%BD%A2%E9%AA%A8%E6%9E%B6\" title=\"双头形骨架\">双头形骨架</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">双头骨架。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110403\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\"><img alt=\"祝圣秘银\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/100px-Item-110403.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/150px-Item-110403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/Item-110403.png/200px-Item-110403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9D%E5%9C%A3%E7%A7%98%E9%93%B6\" title=\"祝圣秘银\">祝圣秘银</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">闪闪发光的银锭，祝圣仪式让它光可鉴人。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110503\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\"><img alt=\"百灵百验鸟\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/100px-Item-110503.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/150px-Item-110503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Item-110503.png/200px-Item-110503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BE%E7%81%B5%E7%99%BE%E9%AA%8C%E9%B8%9F\" title=\"百灵百验鸟\">百灵百验鸟</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">玻璃鸟儿，不会唱歌。不耐高温，轻拿轻放。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111002\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%88%AA%E7%81%B5%E6%91%86\" title=\"金爪灵摆\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%88%AA%E7%81%B5%E6%91%86\" title=\"金爪灵摆\"><img alt=\"金爪灵摆\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-111002.png/100px-Item-111002.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-111002.png/150px-Item-111002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Item-111002.png/200px-Item-111002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E7%88%AA%E7%81%B5%E6%91%86\" title=\"金爪灵摆\">金爪灵摆</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">昂贵的灵摆。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110603\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BF%BC%E9%80%A0%E9%97%A8%E5%8C%99\" title=\"翼造门匙\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BF%BC%E9%80%A0%E9%97%A8%E5%8C%99\" title=\"翼造门匙\"><img alt=\"翼造门匙\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Item-110603.png/100px-Item-110603.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Item-110603.png/150px-Item-110603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Item-110603.png/200px-Item-110603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BF%BC%E9%80%A0%E9%97%A8%E5%8C%99\" title=\"翼造门匙\">翼造门匙</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">不是每把钥匙生来都长着翅膀的。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110703\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\"><img alt=\"弯曲鹅颈\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/100px-Item-110703.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/150px-Item-110703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/Item-110703.png/200px-Item-110703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%AF%E6%9B%B2%E9%B9%85%E9%A2%88\" title=\"弯曲鹅颈\">弯曲鹅颈</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">形如鹅颈般优美的零件。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/111012\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A0%82%E9%87%91%E7%94%B2%E8%99%AB\" title=\"砂金甲虫\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A0%82%E9%87%91%E7%94%B2%E8%99%AB\" title=\"砂金甲虫\"><img alt=\"砂金甲虫\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Item-111012.png/100px-Item-111012.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Item-111012.png/150px-Item-111012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Item-111012.png/200px-Item-111012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A0%82%E9%87%91%E7%94%B2%E8%99%AB\" title=\"砂金甲虫\">砂金甲虫</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">甲虫的躯壳成为了一具精致的吊坠。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110803\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%91%E8%8D%89%E7%84%9A%E9%A6%99\" title=\"金草焚香\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uplo